 of Cthulhu, maybe it'll be like the Water Purview in Masks gives you visible gills?</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be mighty fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-31T12:13:01-07:00","id":1333421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1333318-what-kind-of-powers-do-you-think-scions-in-mythos-will-have?p=1333401#post1333401\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I heard a rumor that the Purviews in Masks will be different to a degree, probably to fit the tone better.<br /> <br /> Like, there will still be a Fire Purview, but it probably won't have the same innate power, or it may have some drawbacks associated with using it.<br /> <br /> Given the aesthetics of Cthulhu, maybe it'll be like the Water Purview in Masks gives you visible gills?</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... If that is the case, I wonder which Purview would turn you into a ghoul?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_lin